<body bgcolor="#F1F7FF" style="margin: 0px; background-size: cover; background-color: rgb(241, 247, 255); height: auto; min-height: auto;" width="100%">
<center style="width: 100%; background: #F1F7FF; text-align: left;">
<div class="email-container" style="max-width: 680px; margin: auto;">
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 680px;" width="100%">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding:10px 20px 0; font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; color: #000000; text-align: center;">
			<p style="margin: 0;">&nbsp;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 20px 0 0; text-align: center;"><a href="https://mailing.edenred.be/optiext/optiextension.dll?ID=aZVaGwCo4QKxiHARi9hXkr3VwuyL3oNQwPL_VBp9F8byKbJfyyJzoD12zbj4xAy8a%2BsJo9oFf0prUpHGYfxCHWJOKraaaG" target="_blank"><img alt="" border="0" src="https://edenred-be.emsecure.net/images//BIBLIOTHEQUE_LOGO/logo_edenred_color.png" style="width: auto; height: 60px;" width="250" /> </a></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="center"><img align="center" alt="Collaboration offer for your Meal Tickets" border="0" class="header" src="https://campaign.edenred.be/images/IMAGES_NEW/SALESFORCE/AUTOMATIC_OFFER_CLIENT/OFFERLIGHT/header_tr_fr.png" style="width: 100%; max-width: 680px; height: auto;" width="680" /></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td bgcolor="#ffffff">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding: 10px 40px 20px; font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 140%; color: #000000;">
						<p style="margin: 0;">Hello {{{Quote.ER_DocuGen_Contact_First_Name__c}}},<br />
						<br />
						Thank you for your request for <strong>Edenred Solutions</strong>. You are just a few clicks away from granting yourself the extra-legal advantage <span style="color: #F72717;"><strong>number 1 in Luxemburg&nbsp;</strong></span><span style="color: #F72717;"><strong>!</strong></span><br />
						<br />
						I am delighted to send you our tailor-made collaboration offer.</p>

						<p style="margin: 0;">You are in Belgium!</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>
			<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background: #ffffff;" width="100%">
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td class="pad-0-20-20-20" style="padding: 0 40px 20px 40px; font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; color: #000000; text-align: left;">Discover our offer in detail below.</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			<br />
			&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td bgcolor="#ffeef1" style="padding: 20px 40px 10px;border-radius: 25px;">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding: 0 0 20px;font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 140%; color: #000000; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;">
						<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;">At Edenred,<br />
						you get more for your money 💶</h2>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding: 0; font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 140%; color: #000000; font-size: 16px;text-align: center;">
						<p style="margin: 0;">More than <strong>60,000 companies</strong> trust us, and it&rsquo;s not for nothing!</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td bgcolor="#ffeef1" style="padding: 20px 40px 0;">
			<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<th class="fullWidth" style="width:40px">
						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td align="center" class="pad-0-20-20-20" style="padding: 0 0 20px 40px;width:40px;"><img alt="." border="0" src="https://campaign.edenred.be/images/TEMPLATE/2023_MASTER_TEMPLATE/default-icoStar.png" style="display: block;width:40px;" width="40" /></td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
						</th>
