							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td class="fz-p ta-c pad-0-20-20-20" style="font-family: 'Ubuntu', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;font-weight: 400; text-align: left;padding:0 40px 20px 70px;">We simplify your life: a <strong>user-friendly platform</strong> for ordering, a <strong>simple and modern app</strong> for using your titles, clear information for your employees. We think of everything for you.</td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
